#### both representations agree on element count for the same shape

- Verify: both representations agree on element count for the same shape


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: both representations agree on element count for the same shape")
val p = tensor_ones([2, 3, 4])
val t = Tensor.ones([2, 3, 4], requires_grad: false)
assert_equal(p.numel(), t.numel())
```

